# Station Rescue gateway (from TVGSUOS)

When the task is **Station Rescue** (SR, stationrescue.com, station-rescue.vercel.app, `Desktop/.../station-rescue`, services / parts / contractors marketplace):

## In

- Three ICPs only: **station owners**, **technicians**, **suppliers**
- Loop: parts/pumps on the catalog → technicians install
- Owners free and verified; supplier subscription + ads + appointment fees (not live checkout until built)
- No cut of job value; gensets stay
- **Dipstify** only as: ops sibling — not this product, do not merge
- **Helium** as the first station cluster; **HMC** as legal/privacy operator

## Out (unless the founder named it in this thread)

- Do not name, fence, or “don’t use” other ventures, apps, personas, or content engines
- A “don’t mix” note still mixes. Stay silent on them
- Do not import another product’s GTM, influencers, or channels into SR plans
- Umbrella memory loading is not permission to mention those products

## If unsure

Ask once. Do not freestyle a second app or a brand crossover.
Keep answers short.
